# Halt on CRUDRepository child fields

HALT IMMEDIATELY if a generated repository child member is `CRUDRepository`, `ICRUDRepository`, or `Arc<CRUDRepository>`.

C#, TypeScript, and Rust child fields are the generated class (`AddressesRepository Address`, `readonly address: AddressesRepository`, `pub address: AddressesRepository`). Construct them with `new AddressesRepository(connection)` / `AddressesRepository::new`. Do not unwrap a child to `CRUDRepository`.

`npm test` runs `scripts/generated-child-repos.test.mjs`. That is the check. E2E is not.
